# Brain backup repo (db-327). Allowlist, not blocklist.
#
# The root of the workspace holds ~27 GB: a 19 GB vendored code corpus, an 8.3 GB
# rag.db, node_modules, and secrets_registry.md in plaintext. A blocklist here would
# be one forgotten line away from committing any of it, so everything is ignored by
# default and only the directories below are let back in. Inside them, only text is
# kept: binaries live in Drive/Perforce and are not what this repo exists to protect.
#
# Deliberately NOT here, and why:
#   assistant/ skills/ cc-hive/ elias_bizdev/ shared/ umbrella/ water_me_and_you/
#                        -> have their own remotes already
#   code-corpus/ _research/  -> vendored, recoverable from GitHub/Perforce
#   secrets_registry.md      -> plaintext secrets; encrypted Drive copy only
#   rag.db                   -> derived index, rebuildable from its sources

# 1. Ignore everything at the root.
/*

# 2. Let the irreplaceable directories back in.
!/1993_space_machine/
!/agents/
!/aurora_punks/
!/aurorapunks_site/
!/badass/
!/clients/
!/curveball/
!/czp/
!/czp-finances/
!/dark_riviera/
!/disposable_corps/
!/drafts/
!/eternal_minds/
!/followups/
!/go_fight_fantastic/
!/hooja/
!/_inbox/
!/k2c_sands_of_duat/
!/knives_and_gutters/
!/mcp-servers/
!/nabohero/
!/paradox_ironcrest_case/
!/personal_listings/
!/pitches/
!/projects/
!/rankone/
!/research/
!/robotlordrising_site/
!/starbreeze_irons2/
!/tcg_webshop/
!/tears_of_adria/
!/teef/
!/ticker/
!/upvote_starbreeze/
!/wiki/
!/_memory/
!/.gitignore

# 3. Never descend into these, wherever they appear.
node_modules/
.venv/
venv/
__pycache__/
.next/
dist/
build/
*.egg-info/

# 4. Keep text only. Binaries are in Drive/Perforce.
*.png
*.jpg
*.jpeg
*.gif
*.webp
*.svg
*.ico
*.psd
*.ai
*.mp4
*.mov
*.webm
*.mp3
*.wav
*.zip
*.tar
*.tar.gz
*.tgz
*.gz
*.7z
*.rar
*.pdf
*.xlsx
*.xls
*.docx
*.doc
*.pptx
*.ttf
*.otf
*.woff
*.woff2
*.db
*.sqlite
*.sqlite3
*.bin
*.exe
*.dll
*.so
*.dylib

# 5. Secrets, belt and braces.
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
*credentials*.json
*-credentials*
*.pem
*.key
.fortnox-profile/

# 6. Redundant once git has history: the agents' own rolling backups of learnings,
#    and scratch backup copies scattered through project folders.
.backup/
*.bak
*.bak-*
*.bak[0-9]*
*.pre-normalize.*
*~

# 7. Stragglers the extension list missed.
*.xlsm
*.xlsb
*.numbers
*.sketch

# 8. Nested repo with its own history but no remote. A gitlink here would back up
#    nothing (clones cannot resolve it), so it is excluded from this repo and
#    captured whole, .git and all, by the encrypted Drive tarball instead.
#    Proper fix is to give it its own remote. See db-327.
/tcg_webshop/app/
